,\n        \"zh_hk\": \"arkclaw版openclaw\",\n        \"zh_tw\": \"arkclaw版openclaw\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"parent_task_guid\": \"\",\n    \"repeat_rule\": \"FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR;INTERVAL=1\",\n    \"source\": 7,\n    \"status\": \"todo\",\n    \"subtask_count\": 0,\n    \"summary\": \"填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表\",\n    \"task_id\": \"t145188\",\n    \"tasklists\": [\n      {\n        \"section_guid\": \"fb8168a1-9ee1-2d8e-4438-e798f1eb65cb\",\n        \"tasklist_guid\": \"1cfa0040-7f1a-47e8-92c9-f7b98785e717\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"updated_at\": \"1775266541252\",\n    \"url\": \"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=94db430f-e66c-4604-a42a-9385bb753ac5&suite_entity_num=t145188\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"task":{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1775178543003","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"\n请填写天津瑞湾每周核心关注事项表！\n\n📋 **填写方式（3种，任选）**：\n1. 多维表格直接填写：https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/SEEebBQRFaLHbyscEwGcK5s5n2f\n2. 飞书U文档并发填写（推荐）：https://www.feishu.cn/docx/MA9MdIBRjoB1owxJMWGcmUZfnhd\n3. 在群里直接说，我来帮你整理！（最简单）\n\n🎤 **今日可用的\"嘴控\"方式**：\n- 手机输入法麦克风：说话转文字，复制到文档\n- 电脑系统语音输入：Mac按Fn两次，Windows按Windows+H\n- 在群里直接说：我帮你整理成结构化内容！\n\n📊 **需要填写的内容**：\n1. 填写日期\n2. 本周百达卡售卡目标\n3. 本周企业卡发展目标\n4. 本周企业会员数发展目标\n5. 核心动作1（客房）\n6. 核心动作2（餐饮）\n7. 核心动作3\n8. 上周实际完成情况复盘\n\n📚 **相关文档**：\n- 🚀 今日可用MVP：https://www.feishu.cn/docx/OiWrd0JNvob3tVxnCOucurATnnf\n- 🎨 完整交互设计：https://www.feishu.cn/docx/RNIbd8RWWogZRixA2Z3cNMAdnWe\n- 📚 经验累积库（32家酒店复用）：https://www.feishu.cn/docx/Z9oTdgbKTohFp9xYbkrcHUPGnUe\n\n⏰ **截止时间**：周日下午2点前完成！\n","due":{"is_all_day":false,"timestamp":"1775368800000"},"extra":"","guid":"94db430f-e66c-4604-a42a-9385bb753ac5","is_milestone":false,"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"arkclaw版openclaw","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"arkclaw版openclaw","en_us":"arkclaw版openclaw","es_es":"arkclaw版openclaw","fr_fr":"arkclaw版openclaw","it_it":"arkclaw版openclaw","ja_jp":"arkclaw版openclaw","ko_kr":"arkclaw版openclaw","ru_ru":"arkclaw版ope